/* 示例自己的样式表（不属于框架）
 *
 * 框架样式表是 resources/themes/ribbon.qss，只包含框架自己的控件；
 * 这里放的是**示例页面**的东西：Backstage 的导航与页面、Dialog Box Launcher 的弹窗等。
 *
 * 写法与框架样式表一致：颜色写成 @{键名} 占位符，由 QmRibbonTheme 按当前主题替换，
 * 所以换主题（浅色 / 深色 / 跟随系统）时这些样式也会跟着变。
 *
 * 生效方式见 examples/simple/main.cpp：
 *     QmRibbonThemeMgr::instance().setExtraStyleSheet(读取本文件);
 * 管理器会把它追加在框架样式表之后应用到窗口上，并在主题变化时自动重新解析。
 *
 * 备注：等框架级的 QmRibbonBackstageView 落地后，下面 #Backstage* 这些 objectName
 * 约定可以整体搬回框架（示例这边只需删掉本文件里对应的段落）。
 */

/* ---------- Dialog Box Launcher（↘）的模拟弹窗 ---------- */
#RibbonLauncherPopup {
    background-color: @{contentBackground};
    border: 1px solid @{borderStrong};
}

#RibbonLauncherPopupTitle {
    background: transparent;
    color: @{text};
    font-size: 14px;
}

#RibbonLauncherPopupHint {
    background: transparent;
    color: @{mutedText};
    font-size: 11px;
}

#RibbonLauncherPopupPreview {
    background-color: @{surface};
    border: 1px solid @{surfaceBorder};
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: @{text};
    padding: 10px;
}

/* ---------- Backstage（File 页面） ---------- */
#BackstageView,
#BackstageContent {
    background-color: @{contentBackground};
}

#BackstageNav {
    background-color: @{windowBackground};
}

#BackstageNavSeparator {
    background-color: @{separator};
    border: none;
    max-height: 1px;
}

#BackstageBackButton {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 18px;
    color: @{accent};
    font-size: 18px;
    /* 固定尺寸（36×36）的图标按钮：必须自己声明 padding: 0，
     * 否则框架里 QPushButton 的通用内边距会把内容区吃光，「←」会被挤成一小段。 */
    padding: 0;
}

#BackstageBackButton:hover {
    background-color: @{hover};
}

#BackstageNavItem,
#BackstageNavCommand {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding-left: 9px;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: @{text};
}

#BackstageNavItem:hover,
#BackstageNavCommand:hover {
    background-color: @{hover};
}

#BackstageNavItem:checked {
    background-color: @{navChecked};
    border-left: 3px solid @{accent};
    color: @{accent};
}

#BackstagePageTitle {
    background: transparent;
    font-size: 22px;
    color: @{text};
}

#BackstagePageSubtitle {
    background: transparent;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: @{secondaryText};
}

#BackstageCard {
    background-color: @{surface};
    border: 1px solid @{surfaceBorder};
    border-radius: 6px;
}

#BackstageCardTitle {
    background: transparent;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: @{text};
}

#BackstageCardText {
    background: transparent;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: @{secondaryText};
}

#BackstageRow {
    background-color: transparent;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 6px;
}

#BackstageRow:hover {
    background-color: @{surfaceHover};
    border-color: @{surfaceBorder};
}

#BackstageRowTitle {
    background: transparent;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: @{text};
}

#BackstageRowText {
    background: transparent;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: @{mutedText};
}

#BackstageTile {
    background-color: @{inputBackground};
    border: 1px solid @{surfaceBorder};
    border-radius: 6px;
}

#BackstageTile:hover {
    border-color: @{accent};
}

#BackstageTileCaption {
    background: transparent;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: @{text};
}

#BackstageTileText {
    background: transparent;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: @{mutedText};
}

#BackstagePreview {
    background-color: @{contentBackground};
    border: 1px solid @{border};
}

#BackstagePrimaryButton {
    background-color: @{accent};
    border: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: @{onAccent};
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 6px 24px;
}

#BackstagePrimaryButton:hover {
    background-color: @{accentHover};
}

#BackstageView QComboBox {
    background-color: @{inputBackground};
    border: 1px solid @{border};
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 1px 4px;
    min-height: 22px;
    font-size: 12px;
    min-width: 120px;
}

#BackstageView QComboBox:hover {
    border-color: @{borderHover};
}

#BackstageView QCheckBox {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: @{text};
    spacing: 8px;
}

/* 主题选择按钮（Backstage → Account） */
#BackstageThemeButton {
    background-color: @{contentBackground};
    border: 1px solid @{surfaceBorder};
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: @{text};
}

#BackstageThemeButton:hover {
    border-color: @{accent};
}

#BackstageThemeButton:checked {
    background-color: @{buttonChecked};
    border: 2px solid @{accent};
    color: @{accent};
}

/* Backstage 页面里如果用 QmRibbonComboBox，要压过上面那条 #BackstageView QComboBox
 *（它比 #RibbonComboBox 多一个类型选择器，特异性更高）。 */
#BackstageView #RibbonComboBox {
    background-color: @{inputBackground};
    border: 1px solid @{border};
    border-radius: 0;
    padding: 0 6px;
    color: @{text};
    font-size: 12px;
    min-height: 20px;
}

#BackstageView #RibbonComboBox:hover {
    border-color: @{borderHover};
}

#BackstageView #RibbonComboBox:focus,
#BackstageView #RibbonComboBox:on {
    border-color: @{accent};
}

#BackstageView #RibbonComboBox QLineEdit {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    color: @{text};
}
